    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069320/extras/61b61da2f2c2154d61b329ce5f5a89ee.poster.avif?t=1723136441\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069320/extras/61b61da2f2c2154d61b329ce5f5a89ee.webm?t=1723136441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069320/extras/61b61da2f2c2154d61b329ce5f5a89ee.mp4?t=1723136441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE YOUR ESCAPE</h2>Play as an ancient Chimera locked within a subterranean tower in this rogue-lite dungeon crawler. Battle through floors of powerful creatures on your ascent from the ancient prison.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069320/extras/41c02dba5b19cae7a10314a40871ea95.poster.avif?t=1723136441\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069320/extras/41c02dba5b19cae7a10314a40871ea95.webm?t=1723136441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069320/extras/41c02dba5b19cae7a10314a40871ea95.mp4?t=1723136441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GRAFT YOUR WAY TO POWER</h2>Take the powers from your enemies by grafting their limbs to use unique abilities. Use trinkets to create a variety of builds and become an unstoppable force. Unlock relics from the shop to alter your play style from run to run.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND THE TRUTH</h2>Uncover secrets from the tower to find the true reason for your imprisonment. Discover a mysterious ally to assist you in your journey through this perilous world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069320/extras/17b26bd7882423cb868df9f984980e60.poster.avif?t=1723136441\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069320/extras/17b26bd7882423cb868df9f984980e60.webm?t=1723136441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069320/extras/17b26bd7882423cb868df9f984980e60.mp4?t=1723136441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT YOUR WAY OUT</h2>Clear your way through three different floors of the tower, filled with dangers and hazards around every corner. Each floor tells a different piece of the story of the tower for you to uncover.<br><br>Will you be able to escape?",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069320/extras/61b61da2f2c2154d61b329ce5f5a89ee.poster.avif?t=1723136441\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069320/extras/61b61da2f2c2154d61b329ce5f5a89ee.webm?t=1723136441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069320/extras/61b61da2f2c2154d61b329ce5f5a89ee.mp4?t=1723136441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE YOUR ESCAPE</h2>Play as an ancient Chimera locked within a subterranean tower in this rogue-lite dungeon crawler. Battle through floors of powerful creatures on your ascent from the ancient prison.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069320/extras/41c02dba5b19cae7a10314a40871ea95.poster.avif?t=1723136441\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069320/extras/41c02dba5b19cae7a10314a40871ea95.webm?t=1723136441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069320/extras/41c02dba5b19cae7a10314a40871ea95.mp4?t=1723136441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GRAFT YOUR WAY TO POWER</h2>Take the powers from your enemies by grafting their limbs to use unique abilities. Use trinkets to create a variety of builds and become an unstoppable force. Unlock relics from the shop to alter your play style from run to run.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND THE TRUTH</h2>Uncover secrets from the tower to find the true reason for your imprisonment. Discover a mysterious ally to assist you in your journey through this perilous world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069320/extras/17b26bd7882423cb868df9f984980e60.poster.avif?t=1723136441\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069320/extras/17b26bd7882423cb868df9f984980e60.webm?t=1723136441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069320/extras/17b26bd7882423cb868df9f984980e60.mp4?t=1723136441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT YOUR WAY OUT</h2>Clear your way through three different floors of the tower, filled with dangers and hazards around every corner. Each floor tells a different piece of the story of the tower for you to uncover.<br><br>Will you be able to escape?",
    "short_description": "Play as the mythological Chimera in this action-packed rogue-lite. Make your escape from a deadly tower filled with unrelenting enemies as you uncover its dark secrets. Enter this fantasy world and overcome intense challenges, find hidden lore, and discover the true reason behind your imprisonment.",
